Date: Thu, 16 Apr 2026 19:34:21 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 03/14] feat: add gzip decompression support for RPC responses

- Send Accept-Encoding: gzip in HTTP requests
- Decompress gzip responses in invoke_http_bin before deserialization
- Link zlib for decompression
- Fully backwards compatible: only decompresses if server sends gzip
